msgid "Stack observations and owner lifecycle endurance"
msgstr "栈观察与所有者生命周期耐久验证"

msgid ""
"Nexus supplies bounded, read-only paint observations. It does not paint a "
"live stack, create a sampling worker, suspend a task or claim that paint "
"detects every reserved stack byte. Product stack sizing and physical station"
" sampling remain external responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 提供有界、只读的填充模式观察，不填充活动栈、不建立采样 "
"worker、不挂起任务，也不宣称填充模式能检测全部预留栈字节。产品栈预算与物理工位采样仍由外部负责。"

msgid "Core and MSP provenance"
msgstr "Core 与 MSP 来源"

msgid ""
"`nx_stack_observe` accepts the original positive byte capacity of a caller-"
"provenance painted region. It reads at most that capacity, returns the low-"
"address untouched prefix and the remaining touched bytes, and retains no "
"pointer. Invalid, wrapped or output-overlapping spans preserve the output. "
"The original request, stream, owner and task structures gain no fields."
msgstr ""
"`nx_stack_observe` "
"接收调用方证明已填充区域的原始正数字节容量，最多读取该容量，返回低地址未修改前缀及其余已触及字节，不保留指针。无效、回绕或与输出重叠的范围保持输出不变。原"
" request、stream、owner 和 task 结构不增加字段。"

msgid ""
"The region must have been painted while it had no live frames. Sampling "
"needs a quiescent region and excludes the current SP, all live frames and "
"exception reservation. An MSP observation therefore requires boot paint "
"provenance and a reviewed quiescent sampling point. This API does not access"
" the MSP register or repair missing provenance. An all-painted region "
"terminates at its supplied capacity rather than reading beyond the region."
msgstr ""
"区域必须在没有活动栈帧时填充。采样要求区域静止，排除当前 SP、全部活动帧与异常预留。因此 MSP 观察需要启动填充来源与审阅的静止采样点。此 API "
"不读取 MSP 寄存器或修补缺失来源。完全未修改的区域也只读到提供容量，不越界继续扫描。"

msgid ""
"A touched-pattern observation is not a peak measurement: an unwritten frame "
"reservation or a write equal to the paint can remain invisible. It is not "
"stack canary validation or overflow detection. Physical task/MSP sizing "
"still requires workload, nested exception and station evidence."
msgstr ""
"触及模式观察不是峰值测量：未写入的栈帧预留或恰好写入填充值可能不可见。它不是栈 canary 校验或溢出检测。物理任务／MSP "
"预算仍需负载、嵌套异常和工位证据。"

msgid "Optional FreeRTOS static-task binding"
msgstr "可选 FreeRTOS 静态任务绑定"

msgid ""
"`nx_freertos_stack_observe` is compiled only when `[os].trace = true`, "
"including the maintained diagnostic profile. The standard/minimal/lowpower "
"selections do not compile its translation unit. The caller supplies the "
"original static task handle, TCB, stack and word capacity. "
"`xTaskGetStaticBuffers` confirms the exact live TCB/stack identity; it "
"cannot confirm capacity, so capacity remains the original-creation contract."
msgstr ""
"`nx_freertos_stack_observe` 仅在 `[os].trace = true` 时编译，包括维护中的 diagnostic "
"配置。Standard/minimal/lowpower 不编译其 TU。调用方提供原静态任务 handle、TCB、stack 和 word "
"capacity。`xTaskGetStaticBuffers` 确认精确活动 TCB/stack 身份，但不能确认容量；容量仍归原创建合同。"

msgid ""
"Calls require privileged, unmasked running Thread mode. The caller excludes "
"join, deletion, prestart discard, rebinding, reinitialization and writes to "
"the sampled stack through the scan. A returned-and-suspended joinable task "
"can be sampled before its external join; the binding must stop being used "
"before join reclaims the task. No stale handle is queried after deletion."
msgstr ""
"调用要求特权、未屏蔽、运行中 Thread。调用方在整个扫描期间排除 join、delete、启动前 "
"discard、重新绑定／初始化和对采样栈的写入。已返回并挂起的可 join 任务可在外部 join 前采样；join "
"回收任务前必须停止使用绑定。删除后不查询旧 handle。"

msgid ""
"The locked FreeRTOS `tasks.c` fills new static task stacks with `0xA5` under"
" the maintained paint-enabling configuration. The adapter uses that exact "
"paint and performs a capacity-bounded Core scan. It deliberately does not "
"call the kernel's unbounded free-space helper. No extra task/TCB state, "
"masks, queues or runtime registry are introduced."
msgstr ""
"锁定 FreeRTOS `tasks.c` 在维护的启用填充配置下使用 `0xA5` 填充新静态任务栈。适配使用此精确值并执行容量有界 Core "
"扫描，刻意不调用内核无界空闲空间 helper。不引入额外 task/TCB 状态、掩码、队列或运行时注册表。"

msgid ""
"The POSIX FreeRTOS port stores startup bookkeeping in the supplied static "
"array and creates a separate pthread execution stack. Its successful static-"
"buffer query proves API identity and bounded inspection, not an MCU or Linux"
" execution stack peak."
msgstr ""
"POSIX FreeRTOS port 在提供的静态数组存放启动记录，并另建 pthread 执行栈。静态缓冲查询成功只证明 API "
"身份及有界检查，不证明 MCU 或 Linux 执行栈峰值。"

msgid "Measured software cost"
msgstr "已测软件成本"

msgid ""
"Development evidence uses the existing production Runtime CMake graph with "
"Cortex-M4F hard-float, GNU Arm 14.3, `-Os`, `-fshort-enums` and section GC. "
"The standard graph compiles no stack snapshot TU; the diagnostic graph "
"compiles one. A probe compiled with that exact adapter command's ABI "
"measured a 16-byte caller binding and a 12-byte output. Each is caller-owned"
" and optional."
msgstr ""
"开发证据使用既有生产 Runtime CMake 图、Cortex-M4F hard-float、GNU Arm "
"14.3、`-Os`、`-fshort-enums` 与 section GC。Standard 图不编译栈快照 TU，diagnostic "
"图编译一个。按精确适配命令 ABI 编译的探针测得调用方绑定 16 字节、输出 12 字节，均可选且由调用方持有。"

msgid ""
"Owned object sections measured 242 bytes of adapter `.text` and 64 bytes of "
"Core scan `.text`, with zero `.data`/`.bss` in both objects. These are "
"object-code figures before final link alignment and any newly retained "
"kernel identity query; they are not a whole-image Flash delta. Unreferenced "
"sections can be discarded. The snapshot costs at most `words * "
"sizeof(StackType_t)` byte comparisons and copies a fixed-size output. No "
"cycles or interrupt latency are inferred."
msgstr ""
"所属对象 section 测得适配 `.text` 242 字节、Core 扫描 `.text` 64 字节，两者 `.data`/`.bss` "
"均为零。这些是最终链接对齐和新增保留内核身份查询之前的对象代码数据，不是完整镜像 Flash 差值。未引用 section 可丢弃。快照最多执行 "
"`words * sizeof(StackType_t)` 次字节比较并复制定长输出，不推断周期或中断延迟。"

msgid "Real kernel lifecycle endurance"
msgstr "真实内核生命周期耐久测试"

msgid ""
"Two unfiltered cases run 32 and 256 rounds through the actual pinned "
"FreeRTOS POSIX kernel, two real producer tasks, one real owner task, the "
"UART owner and the Native UART provider. Rounds rotate normal completion, "
"cancellation and a failed-drain quarantine followed by explicit successful "
"drain."
msgstr ""
"两个无过滤 case 经实际锁定 FreeRTOS POSIX 内核、两个真实 producer 任务、一个真实 owner 任务、UART owner"
" 和 Native UART 提供者，分别执行 32 与 256 轮。各轮轮换正常完成、取消及排空失败隔离后显式成功排空。"

msgid ""
"Each round verifies that quarantined requests cannot be prepared/reclaimed, "
"producer tasks and owner task are joined, the executor/provider have no "
"retained request/data pointer, the IRQ hint is detached before its sink is "
"destroyed, provider stop completes, notifications are destroyed and the "
"kernel task count returns to the pre-round baseline. Fatal cleanup failure "
"aborts the fixture instead of releasing storage while tasks still borrow it."
msgstr ""
"每轮校验隔离请求不能 prepare／reclaim，producer 和 owner 任务已 join，executor／provider 不保留 "
"request/data 指针，IRQ 提示在 sink 销毁前 detach，provider stop "
"完成，通知销毁，内核任务数量回到轮前基线。致命清理失败中止夹具，不在任务仍借用时释放存储。"

msgid ""
"The large hosted fixture is explicitly test-owned outside the coordinator's "
"pthread stack. A bounded scheduler-suspend guard around Native hardware "
"model steps prevents the signal-driven POSIX scheduler from parking a "
"pthread mutex holder and running another model user. It is fixture "
"composition and does not change a production provider or MCU scheduling "
"rule."
msgstr ""
"大型主机夹具由测试显式持有，位于协调者 pthread 栈之外。Native 硬件模型步骤周围使用有界 scheduler-suspend "
"guard，防止信号驱动 POSIX 调度器挂起 pthread mutex 持有者而运行另一模型使用者。这是夹具组合，不改变生产提供者或 MCU "
"调度规则。"

msgid ""
"The resulting 288 rounds establish this software lifecycle on Linux. Native "
"IRQ hints and modeled TC/drain are not physical interrupts or wire evidence."
" Physical soak, real UART/DMA wake latency and board current measurements "
"remain not executed until the three-board station is connected."
msgstr ""
"288 轮结果建立 Linux 上此软件生命周期。Native IRQ 提示与模型 TC／drain "
"不是物理中断或线侧证据。三板工位接入前，物理耐久、真实 UART/DMA 唤醒延迟和板级电流测量仍未执行。"
